  "body": "Glad to hear you succeed! I don't think the GitHub packages lack anything though, I'm not sure what you mean. If you want the plugins for image loading and saving (including jxl), they can always be installed separately from the https://github.com/artraweditor/ART-imageio repo. In fact, this can be automated using the bundle_ART.py script with the proper flag, but installing by hand should be similar. \nI agree the whole procedure is badly documented, to put it mildly. That's definitely an area where help would be appreciated :-)",
